    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/35b4e8944da36d84ca7dca3f06ff6875.poster.avif?t=1751528114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/35b4e8944da36d84ca7dca3f06ff6875.webm?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/35b4e8944da36d84ca7dca3f06ff6875.mp4?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit distinctive fighters to join your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your squad into the chaotic battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire a vast array of extraordinary mods during battles to strengthen your fighters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formidable enemies will test your teamwork and strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/abbcb5781d179a0cce2734e5e7662a74.poster.webp?t=1751528114\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/abbcb5781d179a0cce2734e5e7662a74.webp?t=1751528114\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playthrough is unique. Whether you succeed or fail, you\u2019ll earn research materials. The logistics and engineering team will make good use of them to bolster your combat capabilities</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d7b1d774da5f27fa9a01bde61fbdec10.poster.avif?t=1751528114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d7b1d774da5f27fa9a01bde61fbdec10.webm?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d7b1d774da5f27fa9a01bde61fbdec10.mp4?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a wide variety of playable characters, each with unique abilities and upgrade paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d83a486ca258aa2789b459847ed15aad.avif?t=1751528114\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/35b4e8944da36d84ca7dca3f06ff6875.poster.avif?t=1751528114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/35b4e8944da36d84ca7dca3f06ff6875.webm?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/35b4e8944da36d84ca7dca3f06ff6875.mp4?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit distinctive fighters to join your team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your squad into the chaotic battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire a vast array of extraordinary mods during battles to strengthen your fighters</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Formidable enemies will test your teamwork and strategy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/abbcb5781d179a0cce2734e5e7662a74.poster.webp?t=1751528114\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/abbcb5781d179a0cce2734e5e7662a74.webp?t=1751528114\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Construction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each playthrough is unique. Whether you succeed or fail, you\u2019ll earn research materials. The logistics and engineering team will make good use of them to bolster your combat capabilities</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d7b1d774da5f27fa9a01bde61fbdec10.poster.avif?t=1751528114\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d7b1d774da5f27fa9a01bde61fbdec10.webm?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d7b1d774da5f27fa9a01bde61fbdec10.mp4?t=1751528114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Diverse Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a wide variety of playable characters, each with unique abilities and upgrade paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1833540/extras/d83a486ca258aa2789b459847ed15aad.avif?t=1751528114\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "In the war-torn stellar abyss, every battle is unique! Stars Era: Abyss Frontier merges tactical strategy with Roguelike mechanics. Dynamic generated battlefields &amp; enemies test your real-time tactics. Unlock combat modules post-battle to build your unique arsenal against seemingly invincible foes!",
